57: ### 2.3 Adaptive Gamma (Non-Stationarity Detection)
58: 
59: **File:** `brain.py` — `_adapt_gamma()`
60: 
61: - Tracks a rolling window of 50 recent rewards
62: - Every 25 updates, compares variance between first and second half of window
63: - If variance spikes (>40% increase or >0.35 absolute): gamma decreases by 0.03, floor at 0.85
64: - When variance normalizes: gamma creeps back toward baseline at 0.005 per cycle
65: - LinUCB model gamma is synced in real-time
66: 
67: **Use case:** Exam weeks, seasonal shifts, curriculum changes.
